<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4580"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Metalhead<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Metalhead<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 23, 2005 - 9:59 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->maybe it was a mixer that doubled as a vibrator!!that would be an interesting story to verify.it would seem that the wpd does not have much credibility with people and after 30 years i understand why.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
