<!--/Post: 4681-->
<!--Post: 4684--><!--Time: 1106674408-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4684"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Cougar<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Cougar<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, January 25, 2005 - 9:33 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Most men would. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4684-->
<!--Post: 4696--><!--Time: 1106686481-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4696"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Ginefur<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Ginefur<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, January 25, 2005 - 12:54 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Regarding the woman who lived on Pinecrest...in my daily activities,  I routinely run into a woman that is a close personal friend of the woman who lived on Pinecrest.  She told me the story back in March after BTK&#39;s reappearance.   <BR>I had the opportunity to talk to her about it very recently and she&#39;s going to call the woman soon and see if she can add anything and possibly answer some of our questions.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4696-->
<!--Post: 4740--><!--Time: 1106705142-->
