<!--/Post: 4740-->
<!--Post: 4744--><!--Time: 1106706371-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4744"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Teardrop<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Teardrop<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, January 25, 2005 - 6:26 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Since BTK likes to coonfinger through everybody&#39;s stuff, I would not be surprised that he came across something as personal as her vibrator. Doing things like little alterations in placement of objects was what Manson termed &#39;creepy crawling&#39;. It messes with the mind. Again, I say that the citizens of Wichita will be outraged if they ever learn the entire truth about BTK&#39;s activities and what was hidden from them.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4744-->
<!--Post: 6197--><!--Time: 1107573394-->
